OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm closing my charity so I can
OL,4,Afocus on living'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who set up a charity in memory
OL,7,Fof her son after he died from an
OL,8,Fepilepsy-related condition has said she
OL,9,Fis closing it so she can focus on
OL,10,F"living" and return to being "Jon's
OL,11,Fmum".
OL,13,FWendy Shaw founded the Jon Shaw
OL,14,FFoundation in 2020, a year after her
OL,15,Fson Jon died aged 19 from Sudden
OL,16,FUnexpected Death in Epilepsy (Sudep).
OL,18,FSince then, the charity has raised more
OL,19,Fthan #300,000 to fund equipment and
OL,20,Fservices not routinely available on the
OL,21,FNHS, including seizure monitors and
OL,22,Falarms.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
