OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm closing my charity so I can
OL,4,Afocus on living'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Wendy, from Crewe, Cheshire,
OL,7,Fannounced on Sunday that the charity
OL,8,Fwould be wound up at the end of 2026
OL,9,Ffollowing what she described as a lot
OL,10,Fof "heart searching and discussion".
